{
  "_comment": [
    "One entry per benchmark dataset. url: the viewer page (run.mjs adds bench=1, and volumes/position/target for clip strokes).",
    "pointcloud: the cloud strokes target (pc.name in the scene); a stroke's own pointcloud, recorded at capture, wins.",
    "targetClass: painted by every stroke; must be absent from the data (it is checked against resident points before each stroke).",
    "hiddenClass: hidden in the 'hidden' condition; must also be absent. block: URL patterns blocked so strokes start from an empty ledger.",
    "forceLoadAll: load every node before the stroke (Pantheon). Timeouts in minutes; strokes may set timeoutMin.",
    "largeStrokeRadius (meters) + largeStrokeTimeoutMin: make_strokes.py gives strokes at least this big the longer timeout."
  ],
